#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_pages.html.twig:73
msgid "External URL"
msgstr "URL externe"

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_pages.html.twig:73
msgid ""
"Enter the URL that the user will be redirected to instead of displaying the "
"content defined in the previous field. Setting this option disables editing "
"of the page body."
msgstr ""
"Saisissez l'URL vers laquelle l'utilisateur sera redirigé au lieu d'afficher "
"le contenu défini dans le champ précédent. Définir de cette option désactive "
"la modification du corps de la page."

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_pages.html.twig:78
msgid "Use a valid external URL"
msgstr "Utilisez une URL externe valide"

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:15
msgid "Pages"
msgstr "Pages"

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:20
msgid "Enable the \"Legal Information\" page"
msgstr "Activer la page \"Informations légales\""

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:26
msgid "Enable the \"Terms of Service\" page"
msgstr "Activer la page \"Conditions générales d'utilisation\""

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:32
msgid "Enable the \"Privacy Policy\" page"
msgstr "Activer la page \"Politique de confidentialité\""

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:39
msgid "Move links in the \"Public pages\" menu"
msgstr "Déplacer les liens dans le menu \"Pages publiques\""

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:39
msgid ""
"Links are added by default in the footer. Enable this option if you want to "
"move them in the \"Public pages\" menu."
msgstr ""
"Les liens sont ajoutés par défaut dans le pied de page. Activez cette option "
"si vous souhaitez les déplacer dans le menu \"Pages publiques\"."

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:45
msgid "Fallback language for untranslated pages"
msgstr "Langue de secours pour les pages non traduites"

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:59
msgid "Consent Manager Platform"
msgstr "Plateforme de Gestion du Consentement"

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:64
msgid "Enable the consent manager"
msgstr "Activer le gestionnaire de consentement"

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:64
msgid ""
"If you enable this option, you must define which services should be included "
"in the consent manager. Read the plugin documentation to learn how to do "
"this."
msgstr ""
"Si vous activez cette option, vous devez définir les services qui doivent "
"être inclus dans le gestionnaire de consentement. Lisez la documentation du "
"plugin pour savoir comment procéder."

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:71
msgid "Hide the \"Accept all\" button"
msgstr "Cacher le bouton \"Accepter tout\""

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:71
#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:78
msgid ""
"Do not enable this option if you need to comply with the european "
"legislation (GDPR & ePrivacy)."
msgstr ""
"N'activez pas cette option si vous devez vous conformer à la législation "
"européenne (RGPD & ePrivacy)."

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:78
msgid "Hide the \"I decline\" button"
msgstr "Cacher le bouton \"Je refuse\""

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:85
msgid "Enable \"localStorage\""
msgstr "Activer \"localStorage\""

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:85
msgid ""
"By default, consent information is stored in the browser with a cookie. "
"Enable this option if you want to use \"locaStorage\" instead."
msgstr ""
"Par défaut, les informations de consentement sont stockées dans le "
"navigateur avec un cookie. Activez cette option si vous souhaitez utiliser « "
"locaStorage » à la place."

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:93
msgid "Cookie lifetime"
msgstr "Durée de vie du cookie"

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:93
msgid ""
"Specify the maximum lifetime of the cookie used to store consent information "
"in the browser (in days). After this period, the user's consent will be "
"requested again."
msgstr ""
"Spécifiez la durée de vie maximale du cookie utilisé pour stocker les "
"informations de consentement dans le navigateur (en jours). Après cette "
"période, le consentement de l'utilisateur sera à nouveau demandé."

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:101
msgid "Cookie domain"
msgstr "Domaine du cookie"

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:101
msgid ""
"Use this if you want to get consent once for multiple matching domains. By "
"default, the current domain is used."
msgstr ""
"Utilisez cette option si vous souhaitez obtenir le consentement une seule "
"fois pour plusieurs domaines correspondants. Par défaut, le domaine actuel "
"est utilisé."

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:35
msgid ""
"The consent manager could not be loaded. It may have been blocked by an ad "
"blocker."
msgstr ""
"Le gestionnaire de consentement n'a pas pu être chargé. Il a peut-être été "
"bloqué par un bloqueur de publicités."

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:56
msgid "Services we would like to use"
msgstr "Services que nous souhaitons utiliser"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:57
msgid ""
"Here you can assess and customize the services that we'd like to use on this "
"website. You're in charge! Enable or disable services as you see fit."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez ici évaluer et personnaliser les services que nous aimerions "
"utiliser sur ce site. C'est vous qui décidez ! Activez ou désactivez les "
"services comme bon vous semble."

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:60
msgid "Testing mode!"
msgstr "Mode test !"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:61
msgid "There were changes since your last visit, please renew your consent."
msgstr ""
"Il y a eu des changements depuis votre dernière visite, veuillez renouveler "
"votre consentement."

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:62
msgid ""
"Hi! Could we please enable some additional services for {purposes}? You can "
"always change or withdraw your consent later."
msgstr ""
"Bonjour ! Pourrions-nous activer des services supplémentaires pour "
"{purposes} ? Vous pouvez toujours modifier ou retirer votre consentement "
"plus tard."

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:63
msgid "Let me choose"
msgstr "Laissez-moi choisir"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:67
msgid "Service Provision"
msgstr "Prestation de services"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:68
msgid ""
"These services are essential for the correct functioning of this website. "
"You cannot disable them here as the service would not work correctly "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Ces services sont essentiels au bon fonctionnement de ce site. Vous ne "
"pouvez pas les désactiver ici car le service ne fonctionnerait pas "
"correctement autrement."

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:71
msgid "Performance Optimization"
msgstr "Optimisation des performances"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:72
msgid ""
"These services process personal information to optimize the service that "
"this website offers."
msgstr ""
"Ces services traitent les informations personnelles afin d'optimiser le "
"service que ce site Web offre."

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:75
msgid "Analytics"
msgstr "Mesure d'audience"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:76
msgid ""
"These services process personal information to let us know how you use this "
"website."
msgstr ""
"Ces services traitent des informations personnelles pour nous permettre de "
"savoir comment vous utilisez ce site Web."

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:79
msgid "Marketing"
msgstr "Marketing"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:80
msgid ""
"These services process personal information to show you relevant content "
"about products, services or topics that you might be interested in."
msgstr ""
"Ces services traitent les informations personnelles afin de vous présenter "
"un contenu pertinent sur les produits, les services ou les sujets qui "
"pourraient vous intéresser."

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:83
msgid "Advertising"
msgstr "Publicité"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:84
msgid ""
"These services process personal information to show you personalized or "
"interest-based advertisements."
msgstr ""
"Ces services traitent les informations personnelles pour vous présenter des "
"publicités personnalisées ou basées sur des intérêts."

